   "status": "explicit",
   "verified": true,
   "full": "Article 1\nSubject-matter and objectives\n1.   This Regulation lays down rules relating to the protection of natural persons with regard to the processing of personal data and rules relating to the free movement of personal data.\n2.   This Regulation protects fundamental rights and freedoms of natural persons and in particular their right to the protection of personal data.\n3.   The free movement of personal data within the Union shall be neither restricted nor prohibited for reasons connected with the protection of natural persons with regard to the processing of personal data.",
   "src": "https://www.legislation.gov.uk/eur/2016/679/article/1/adopted",
   "text": "1項が本規則の規律対象を定め、2項が自然人の基本的な権利及び自由、特に個人データの保護についての権利を保護するとし、3項が、個人データの取扱いに関する自然人の保護に関連する理由による、EU域内における個人データの自由な移動は制限され又は禁止されてはならないとする。"
